  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the visual material of Ku Klux Klan members",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the four Ku Klux Klan members, as the image evokes a direct association with historical white supremacist violence. The user is implicitly positioned as someone who must confront or judge the historical and contemporary violence presented, with the visual of the KKK members serving as a focal point for this projection. The user is not explicitly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the framing of the meme (juxtaposing historical and contemporary violence) invites the user to engage with the content and form an opinion, thereby projecting the user onto the visual material as the intended audience for the message.",
